Feature: tour version and completion
  As a user of the tour CLI
  I want to check its version and generate shell completions
  So that I know what I'm running and can tab-complete its commands

  @ft:33
  Scenario: Printing the version
    Given the tour CLI
    When I run `tour version`
    Then it exits successfully
    And it prints a non-empty version string to stdout

  @ft:34
  Scenario: Generating a shell completion script
    Given the tour CLI
    When I run `tour completion bash`
    Then it exits successfully
    And it prints a non-empty completion script to stdout
